 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use clock arithmetic to perform the following:",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 505487,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"7+19\">7+19</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"7 + 19 = 26\"></span></p>\n<p>Find 23 mod 12.</p>\n<p>Determine the remainder when 26 is divided by 12.</p>\n<p>26 ÷ 12 = 2 and a remainder. What is that remainder?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"12 \\times 2 = 24\"></span></p>\n<p>Subtract 24 from 26.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"26 – 24 = 2\"></span></p>\n<p>The remainder is 2.</p>\n<p>The remainder is the solution to 26 mod 12.</p>\n<p>26 mod 12 ≡ 2</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "2"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 505488,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"8-31\">8-31</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"8 – 31 = –23\"></span></p>\n<p>Find –23 mod 12.</p>\n<p>It is easier to think about modulo problems when the number is positive. The hand is in the same position every 12 hours, so you can always add any multiple of 12 hours. Add 24 hours to make the number positive.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–23 + 24 = 1\"></span></p>\n<p>Now, find 1 mod 12.</p>\n<p>Determine the remainder when 1 is divided by 12.</p>\n<p>1 ÷ 12 = 0 and a remainder. What is that remainder?</p>\n<p>The remainder is 1.</p>\n<p>The remainder is the solution to 1 mod 12.</p>\n<p>1 mod 12 ≡ 1</p>\n<p>–23 mod 12 = 1</p>\n<p>The answer to 8 – 31 is 1.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 505489,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
