   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"5 \\times 37 = 185\"></span></p>\n<p>Find 185 mod 12.</p>\n<p>Determine the remainder when 185 is divided by 12.</p>\n<p>185 ÷ 12 = 15 and a remainder. What is that remainder?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"12 \\times 15 = 180\"></span></p>\n<p>Subtract 180 from 185.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"185 – 180 = 5\"></span></p>\n<p>The remainder is 5.</p>\n<p>The remainder is the solution to 185 mod 12.</p>\n<p>185 mod 12 ≡ 5</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "5"
    }
   ],
